{"availability":"available","full":"filchyboy/filchyboy.github.io","name":"filchyboy.github.io","description":"Website for Stuff","category":"Other","language":"HTML","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2020-07-06T15:20:58Z","updated":"2026-10-09T14:57:02Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://deanattali.com/beautiful-jekyll","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T19:34:08.143Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T19:34:08.143Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T19:34:08.143Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T18:43:30.672Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-09T19:34:08.143Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Beautiful Jekyll is a ready-to-use template to help you create an awesome website quickly. Perfect for personal sites, blogs, or simple project websites. Check out a demo of what you'll get after just two minutes. You can also look at my personal website to see it in use, or see examples of websites other people created using this theme here.","If you enjoy this theme, please consider supporting me for developing and maintaining this template."],"features":["Beautiful Jekyll is designed to look great on both large-screen and small-screen (mobile) devices. Load up your site on your phone or your gigantic iMac, and the site will work well on both, though it will look slightly…","Many personalization settings in config.yml, such as setting your name and site's description, changing the background colour/image, setting your avatar to add a little image in the navigation bar, customizing the links…","If you want to enable comments on your site, Beautiful Jekyll supports either the Disqus comments plugin, Facebook comments, Staticman or JustComments. If any of these are set in the configuration file, then all blog…","To use Disqus, simply sign up to Disqus and add your Disqus shortname to the disqus parameter in the config.yml file.","To use Facebook comments, create a Facebook app using Facebook developers, and add the Facebook App ID to the fbcommentid parameter in config.yml."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/filchyboy/filchyboy.github.io/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"ed6407fcab60b7b6561c183ee11e96f98324ad8a8b9df053d3921a778d192b25","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T18:43:30.793Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T18:43:30.793Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Beautiful Jekyll is a ready-to-use template to help you create an awesome website quickly. Perfect for personal sites, blogs, or simple project websites. Check out a demo of what you'll get after just two minutes. You can also look at my personal website to see it in use, or see examples of websites other people created using this theme here.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/filchyboy/filchyboy.github.io/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Beautiful Jekyll is a ready-to-use template to help you create an awesome website quickly. Perfect for personal sites, blogs, or simple project websites. Check out a demo of what you'll get after just two minutes. You can also look at my personal website to see it in use, or see examples of websites other people created using this theme here.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/filchyboy/filchyboy.github.io/blob/master/README.md"}],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"You need to have a GitHub account.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/filchyboy/filchyboy.github.io/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"To use JustComments you first need to have an account.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/filchyboy/filchyboy.github.io/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"After you just need to copy the API key to the just-comments property in config.yml file.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/filchyboy/filchyboy.github.io/blob/master/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"ed6407fcab60b7b6561c183ee11e96f98324ad8a8b9df053d3921a778d192b25","sourceUr